\par\par \b \uc2 HKMA sells HK$8.9 bln to keep HK dlr in trading band\b0\par\par\uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 November 2009\par 00:51\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG, Nov 16 (Reuters) - Hong Kong's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 , injected HK$8.912 billion (US$1.15 billion) into the money market in New York trading on Friday to stem an appreciating Hong Kong dollar and keep it within its fixed trading band.\par \par \uc2  This followed a total HK$16.663 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the HKMA during \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading hours on Friday as the Hong Kong dollar repeatedly hit the top of its trading band at 7.7500 as funds continued to flow into the territory for initial public offerings in the stock market and amid some speculation that China could soon resume appreciation of its yuan <CNY=CFXS> \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2  The latest move brought total injections for the day to HK$25.575 billion.\par \par \uc2  According to data on a Reuters page, the latest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will lift the aggregate balance -- the sum of balances on clearing accounts maintained by banks with the HKMA -- to a record HK$315.29 billion by Nov. 17.\par \par \uc2  The Hong Kong dollar is pegged at 7.80 to the U.S. dollar but can trade between 7.75 and 7.85.\par \par \uc2  Under the linked exchange rate mechanism, the HKMA is usually obliged to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to keep the trading band intact if the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hits 7.75 or 7.85.\par \par \uc2  At 2342 GMT on Sunday (0742 Hong Kong time on Monday), it was quoted at 7.7500/01.  (US$1=HK$7.75)  (Reporting by Donny Kwok; editing by Ken Wills)     \par \par \uc2 HONGKONG/HKMA|LANGEN|Z|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|ABX|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020091115e5bf000hu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
