\par\par \b \uc2 Hong Kong dollar inches up, short-dated Hibor fall\b0\par\par\uc2 514 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 September 2009\par 07:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 HONG KONG, Sept 22 (Reuters) - The following is a snapshot of the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money market on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                            Latest           Previous Day\par                            At 0546 GMT      At 0554 GMT\par  HK$ SPOT <HKD=>           7.7502/04        7.7506/07\par  FORWARDS\par  Three-month <HKD3M=>       -56/-53          -55/-53\par  Six-month <HKD6M=>        -111/-106        -111/-106\par  One-year <HKD1Y=>         -195/-185        -197/-187\par  INTERBANK RATES (PERCENTAGE)\par  Overnight <HKDOND=>       0.01/0.05        0.20/0.25\par  One-month <HKD1MD=>       0.05/0.12        0.10/0.14\par  Three-month <HKD3MD=>     0.12/0.20        0.13/0.21\par  Six-month <HKD6MD=>       0.40/0.50        0.40/0.50\par  One-year <HKD1YD=>        0.80/0.87        0.80/0.88\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 For more live quotes of forwards and interbank rates, click on <HKDF=>.\par \par \uc2 * The Hong Kong dollar nudged higher against the U.S. dollar on Tuesday, while short-dated interbank rates declined as money set aside for a heavily subscribed IPO due to launch on Wednesday trickled back into the banking system.\par \par \uc2 * The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  <HKD=> traded between 7.7502 and 7.7506 on the day, near the upper end of its tight band to the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 One dealer at a European bank projected the spot rate would stay in a narrow range, with the prospect of investment fund flows into the city for a spate of ongoing IPO activities.\par \par \uc2 * Casino company Wynn Macau aims to raise $1.6 billion in an IPO, while real estate developer Powerlong Group plans to raise up to $631 million. [ID:nHKG192871][ID:nHKG193873]\par \par \uc2 * The Hong Kong dollar is pegged at 7.80 to the U.S. dollar but can trade between 7.75 and 7.85. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  (HKMA) is usually obliged to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar hits 7.75 or 7.85.\par \par \uc2 * Dealers said short-dated interbank rates fell on Tuesday as the excess funds that had been tied up by Sinopharm's IPO returned to the market.\par \par \uc2 Overnight Hibor <HIHKDOND=> was fixed at 0.05000 percent, down from Monday's 0.21143 percent.\par \par \uc2 One-week Hibor <HIHKD1WD=> dropped to 0.09857 percent from 0.17929 percent.\par \par \uc2 * China's largest pharmaceutical products distributor, \uc2 Sinopharm Group Co Ltd\uc2 , raised $1.13 billion in its IPO. The retail portion of the deal was more than 500 times subscribed. The stock debuts on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 * The overnight forwards <HKDON=> traded back to a discount from a slight premium following softer short-dated interbank rates, dealers said.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, longer-dated forwards were stable in thin activity.\par \par \uc2 * The Hong Kong government is due to release consumer price index (CPI) data for August at 0830 GMT.\par \par \uc2 MARKET/ECONOMIC NEWS \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  > Stock market reports and updates:                       [.HK]\par  > Yuan reports and updates:                              [CNY/]\par  > U.S. dollar reports and updates:                [USD/] [FRX/]\par  > Emerging Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reports and updates:           [EMRG/FRX]\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (Reporting by Christina Lo, Editing by Jacqueline Wong)\f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-HONGKONG/FORWARDS|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|O|OIL|C|GRO|MTL|SOF|Z|RNP|DNP|PTD|PCM|PEN|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090925e59m000o0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip