\par\par \b \uc2 HK dlr hovers near upper limit, eyes on  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 422 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 September 2009\par 07:52\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG, Sept 15 (Reuters) - The following is a snapshot of the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money market on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                            Latest           Previous Day\par                            At 0532 GMT      At 0521 GMT\par  HK$ SPOT <HKD=>           7.7501/01        7.7501/02\par  FORWARDS\par  Three-month <HKD3M=>       -52/-46          -54/-50\par  Six-month <HKD6M=>        -108/-100        -108/-103\par  One-year <HKD1Y=>         -193/-183        -194/-184\par  INTERBANK RATES (PERCENTAGE)\par  Overnight <HKDOND=>       0.10/0.20        0.0001/0.05\par  One-month <HKD1MD=>       0.04/0.14        0.10/0.15\par  Three-month <HKD3MD=>     0.12/0.22        0.13/0.22\par  Six-month <HKD6MD=>       0.40/0.50        0.40/0.50\par  One-year <HKD1YD=>        0.75/0.85        0.80/0.83\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  For more live quotes of forwards and interbank rates, click on <HKDF=>.\par \par \uc2  * The Hong Kong dollar was trapped in a narrow range against the U.S. dollar on Tuesday in typhoon-thinned trade, while short-dated interbank rates kept firm due to IPO activity.\par \par \uc2  * The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  <HKD=> was trading at 7.7501, near the upper end of its tight band to the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2    Dealers said a number of companies are set to list on the Hong Kong bourse in coming weeks and the new issues would boost demand for Hong Kong dollars.\par \par \uc2  * The Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is pegged at 7.80 to the U.S. dollar but can trade between 7.75 and 7.85. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  (HKMA) is usually obliged to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar hits 7.75 or 7.85.\par \par \uc2  * Trading was thin in the morning session as a typhoon forced many businesses to open late. \par \par \uc2    Typhoon Koppu swept past the city on to the South China coastline, with the city's stock market due to reopen in the afternoon with the storm's passing.\par \par \uc2  * The fixing of the Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate (HIBOR) will be postponed to 2:15 pm (Hong Kong time), according to a trader at a local bank.\par \par \uc2  * Hong Kong dollar forwards were little changed in quiet trade, said a dealer at a Japanese bank.\par \par \uc2  MARKET/ECONOMIC NEWS \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  > Stock market reports and updates:                       [.HK]\par  > Yuan reports and updates:                              [CNY/]\par  > U.S. dollar reports and updates:                [USD/] [FRX/]\par  > Emerging Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reports and updates:           [EMRG/FRX]\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2  (Reporting by Christina Lo; Editing by Jonathan Hopfner)\par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-HONGKONG/FORWARDS|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|O|OIL|C|GRO|MTL|SOF|Z|ABX|RNP|DNP|PTD|PCM|PEN   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090918e59f000a4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
