\par\par \b \uc2 HK dollar stays firm on stock market strength\b0\par\par\uc2 430 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juli 2009\par 07:26\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 HONG KONG, July 21 (Reuters) - The following is a snapshot of the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money market on Tuesday morning.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                         Midday              Previous close\par                         At 0300 GMT         At 0813 GMT\par  HK$ SPOT <HKD=>        7.7501/01           7.7501/02 \par  FORWARDS \par  Three-month <HKD3M=>   -61/-59             -58.5/-55.5 \par  Six-month <HKD6M=>     -130/-100           -114.2/-106.7\par  One-year <HKD1Y=>      -189/-177           -184/-155 \par  INTERBANK RATES (PERCENTAGE)\par  Overnight <HKDOND=>    0.01/0.06           0.01/0.02\par  One-month <HKD1MD=>    0.03/0.13           0.01/0.13\par  Three-month <HKD3MD=>  0.07/0.15           0.07/0.37\par  Six-month <HKD6MD=>    0.36/0.44           0.22/0.77\par  One-year <HKD1YD=>     0.78/0.86           0.90/1.22\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 More live quotes of forwards and interbank rates, click on <FWEN>.\par \par \uc2 * The Hong Kong dollar was little changed, staying firm against the U.S. dollar despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 * Following a HK$3.5 billion injection on Friday night, the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold another HK$1.9 billion for U.S. dollars in New York trading on Monday, aiming to keep the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within its fixed trading band.\par \par \uc2 * The Hong Kong dollar is pegged at 7.8 to the U.S. dollar but can be traded between 7.75 and 7.85 to the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The HKMA is usually obliged to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar hits 7.75 or 7.85 to keep the band intact.\par \par \uc2 * A trader attributed the strong local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the IPO of Beijing-based building materials producer BBMG, and bullish Asian stock markets, which revived hopes of an early global economic recovery.\par \par \uc2 * "It is hard to say whether the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will soften against the U.S. dollar after the debut of BBMG, as hot money might continue flowing into Hong Kong to benefit from its proximity to a booming China," one dealer said.\par \par \uc2 * The benchmark Hang Seng Index <.HSI>, which soared 3.7 percent in its fifth straight winning session on Monday, gained 0.19 percent on Tuesday morning.\par \par \uc2 * Interbank rates were mixed, with short-term rates firmer due to the money demand for IPOs, a dealer said.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par           MARKET/ECONOMIC NEWS\par  > Stock market reports and updates:                       [.HK]\par  > Yuan reports and updates:                              [CNY/]\par  > U.S. dollar reports and updates:                [USD/] [FRX/]\par  > Emerging Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reports and updates:           [EMRG/FRX]\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (Reporting by Moxy Ying; Editing by Jonathan Hopfner)\f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-HONGKONG/FORWARDS|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|D|E|RBN|Z|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090724e57l000c7\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchang